  <webwork-reps version="2" webwork2_major_version="2" webwork2_minor_version="20" xml:id="extracted-webwork-2" ww-id="webwork-2">
    <static seed="2" source="Library/TCNJ/TCNJ_RowReduction/problem5.pg">
      <statement><p>Suppose that the following</p>
<p><m>\left\lbrace\begin{array}{rrrrrr}\amp  -6 \, x\amp +\amp  12 \, y\amp =\amp 12\\\amp  -14 \, x\amp +\amp  28 \, y\amp =\amp k\\\amp  -8 \, x\amp +\amp  16 \, y\amp =\amp 16\\ \end{array}\right.</m></p>
<p>is a consistent system.   Then <m>k=</m> <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
      <answer>
        <p>
          <m>28</m>
        </p>
      </answer>
    </static>
